{
  "id": "horror-eternal",
  "title": "HORROR ETERNAL",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Every story hides a nightmare. HORROR ETERNAL is an anthology of original horror featuring tales of psychological terror, supernatural dread, and apocalyptic suspense. Experience The Blackcast , a podcast that corrupts its listeners through forbidden subconscious desires; Bone of My Bones , where a mysterious virus transforms the women of the world into relentless predators; The Missing Touch , the chilling story of a man who can erase anyone from reality with a single touch; and We Are Not Dead , the ongoing nightmare of an alien race that suddenly appears across the globe—not to conquer, not to communicate, but simply to watch. Silent. Motionless. Unreachable. As the world waits for an attack that never comes, the terror grows from one haunting question: Why are they here? Written and performed by Roy Burdine, HORROR ETERNAL invites you into unforgettable stories where every episode leaves the darkness just a little closer. PART OF THE MONSTER FORGE RADIO NETWORK HORROR ETERNAL Copyright 2025-2026 Roy Burdine",
